{title: I Want Jesus to Walk with Me}
{artist: Traditional spiritual}
{genre: Gospel}
{style: Spiritual}
{flow: Meditative}
{key: F}
{tempo: 66}
{time: 4/4}

{start_of_verse: Verse 1}
[F]I want Jesus to walk with me
I want [Bb]Jesus to walk with [F]me
All along my pilgrim [C7]journey
Lord, I want [F]Jesus to walk with [Bb]me[F]
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: Verse 2}
[F]In my trials, Lord, walk with me
In my [Bb]trials, Lord, walk with [F]me
When my heart is almost [C7]breaking
Lord, I want [F]Jesus to walk with [Bb]me[F]
{end_of_verse}
